        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Average of three current machineries sold for the production of electronic components (see general comments).\n\n# Included processes\nThis module includes material, production efforts (transportation, energy, process chemicals, …) and infrastructure for the production of a machinery used in the production line for electronic components. No information about emissions (air, water) and waste are included.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
